WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,800
The first year's special bonus was obtained softly

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:02,840
Who would have thought that when I graduate?

3
00:00:02,840 --> 00:00:04,440
You can't even find a real job

4
00:00:04,440 --> 00:00:05,920
Came here to eat fruit as a snack

5
00:00:05,920 --> 00:00:07,400
I make money by my strength

6
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:08,640
What's wrong with loving you?

7
00:00:08,640 --> 00:00:10,640
Although I, He Kaixiao, am at the bottom of my grades

8
00:00:10,640 --> 00:00:11,800
Frequent make-up exams

9
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:13,840
But when I graduated, I had connections in my family

10
00:00:13,840 --> 00:00:15,760
When I first joined a big company, I was the deputy manager.

11
00:00:15,760 --> 00:00:18,240
A person with a minimum wage earns a commission of 50,000 yuan a month

12
00:00:18,240 --> 00:00:20,880
This car is also a serious Mercedes-Benz.

13
00:00:20,880 --> 00:00:23,080
Sure enough, it is a thirty-year contract with a thirty-year core

14
00:00:23,080 --> 00:00:24,320
Things are impermanent, Zhang Tong

15
00:00:24,320 --> 00:00:26,480
Back then you pretended to be aloof in front of me, but now you are

16
00:00:26,480 --> 00:00:29,080
You don't even deserve to carry my shoes by the back door of my house.

17
00:00:29,200 --> 00:00:30,560
To avoid the waste of fine leaves

18
00:00:30,560 --> 00:00:32,640
You're worthy of shouting in front of me, but you still dare to speak harshly.

19
00:00:32,640 --> 00:00:33,840
Let me see when you can meet the deadline

20
00:00:33,840 --> 00:00:34,880
Today I will ask the whole class to

21
00:00:34,880 --> 00:00:36,160
Look at your useless medicine now

22
00:00:37,910 --> 00:00:38,910
Dear old classmates

23
00:00:38,910 --> 00:00:40,270
Today I went back to school to attend the pre-graduation

24
00:00:40,270 --> 00:00:42,310
Passed the last make-up exam successfully

25
00:00:42,310 --> 00:00:43,630
Guess what I saw on the roadside

26
00:00:43,630 --> 00:00:45,070
What a spectacle

27
00:00:45,070 --> 00:00:53,550
It is definitely something you have never dreamed of. Mr. He is so powerful. Deputy Manager He is just different. What did you see? You saw a sow climbing a tree. Stop being so slow. Manager He, tell me quickly.
